{
  "_comment": "Hazard rules reached through a real inquiry: tier B/C by level, the strong-herb and aristolochic rules, flavour excess, and the population rules that only annotate in dev. (十八反/十九畏 pairs and the pattern-direction conflicts need synthetic candidates and are covered in test/safety.test.ts.)",
